{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to escape from the stress of urban life? <strong>Nom Nom: Cozy Forest Caf\u00e9</strong> is a cozy and relaxing decoration and rhythm game where you manage a caf\u00e9 and befriend cute animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/c67894c9e6e9031f5f932f03ac420f6f.poster.avif?t=1769533540\" width=960 height=283 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/c67894c9e6e9031f5f932f03ac420f6f.webm?t=1769533540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low stress, non confrontational, relaxing experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Manage your own cafeteria\u3011</strong> Customize your place with furniture, decorations, lamps, wallpaper, and flooring. Take pictures of your favourite corners, dishes, and customers and share them on the caf\u00e9's website.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Adorable customers\u3011\u00a0</strong>Forge friendships and learn about their favourite recipes and decorations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/6578d5c33ddb190ecf0d8da74f6effbb.poster.avif?t=1769533540\" width=960 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/6578d5c33ddb190ecf0d8da74f6effbb.webm?t=1769533540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Learn new recipes... To the beat!\u3011</strong> Prepare snacks and drinks, from waffles to sodas, to the rhythm of upbeat tunes and colourful animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Unleash your creativity!\u3011</strong> Practice your skills whenever you like. Experiment with new ingredient combinations and sell them in your own vending machine to earn rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Use your own custom designs!\u3011</strong> You can customise different objects, as well as your dishes! Paint signs, posters and even T-shirts for your customers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/7b47f32fd21e49900542758190d2a2f6.poster.avif?t=1769533540\" width=960 height=283 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/7b47f32fd21e49900542758190d2a2f6.webm?t=1769533540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the forest!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2428800/9662a2bcb1a0257d43f2b829943e12afabc4c330.jpg"},{"name":"First friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2428800/8221d4bd67436d259bd8b15727be29b25163ce21.jpg"},{"name":"Loyal friend","path"